WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.741
Mbaku is an AI that answers questions about your opponent, using only their games.

00:00:06.191 --> 00:00:09.727
Open your opponent's page, and tap Ask Mbaku AI.

00:00:10.177 --> 00:00:13.136
Type a question, or pick one of the suggestions.

00:00:13.586 --> 00:00:19.681
For example: what does he play against 1.e4 as Black, and how does he score? Then tap Ask.

00:00:20.131 --> 00:00:23.496
Mbaku reads every game you've imported for this player.

00:00:23.946 --> 00:00:30.340
Then answers in seconds. Here: mainly the Sicilian, scoring 79% in the Najdorf.

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:35.072
It also tells you where the numbers are thin, so you know how far to trust them.

00:00:35.522 --> 00:00:40.572
Twenty questions a month are included. Try it at chesspreparatory.com.
